  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with multiprofile and scvi_n200 achieve high accuracy (0.65), but multimodal approaches with resnet50 (config_030) underperform. This experiment tests a multimodal model using the same scvi_n200 RNA encoder but replaces resnet50 with ViT (imagenet_vit_l), isolating the impact of image encoder choice. This clarifies whether ViT, a more modern architecture, could improve performance, addressing uncertainty about image modality effectiveness without altering other critical parameters."
